            "rationale": "The relative clause “that showed...” correctly gives information about the map."
          },
          {
            "text": "Mira borrowed a map, which the walking trails around Lake Verdan showed.",
            "isKey": false,
            "misconception": "INCORRECT_RELATIVE_CLAUSE",
